% backend: none
% expect-error: rangecheck
% Scenario: a zero XStep is out of range in makepattern.
<< /PatternType 1 /PaintType 1 /TilingType 1 /BBox [0 0 10 10]
  /XStep 0 /YStep 10 /PaintProc { pop } >> [1 0 0 1 0 0] makepattern
